		name = "Join a Guild.",
		guild_coin_award = 0,
		award = 0,
		type = 17,
		desc = "From the home screen, tap on the \"Guild\" button to access the Guild system.\nOn the Guild screen, you will be able to either form your own guild, or join an existing one.\nGuilds fall under one of two organizations – the Azur Lane, and the Crimson Axis. There are no differences in the features or functionalities of these organizations, so feel free to pick whichever one suits you.\nUpon joining a guild, you will start out as a recruit. Once your contribution reaches 100, you will be promoted to a general member.\nYou can earn Guild Tokens by completing daily/weekly missions and participating in guild operations.\nIf you leave your guild, you will not be able to join another guild for 24 hours.\nAll members of the guild are able to receive perks such as increased oil storage, dock slots, and warehouse storage via the Guild Tech Facilities.\nGuild members can also check the progress of these perks by tapping the \"Tech\" button.\nCertain features of the public guild system are available to you even if you don't join any guild.",
