		desc = "You will be able to conduct a variety of research projects to obtain rewards such as PR blueprints and retrofit blueprints at the Research Academy. Head there from the home screen by tapping on \"Lab\", then \"Research Academy\".\nYou can also quickly access the Research Academy from the side menu on the left-hand side of the home screen.\nYou can initiate a research project by selecting one of the banners, then tapping \"Confirm\". Make sure to check the cost of a research project before starting it. In addition, some research projects will have additional conditions that you must meet before the project can be finished.\nYou can cancel research projects that are not in the research queue by tapping the \"Terminate\" button. However, any items or resources spent to pay the research cost will not be refunded, and no new research projects will appear.",
