		guild_coin_award = 0,
		award = 0,
		type = 17,
		desc = "After you start a research project, it must run for the specified duration before you can obtain the rewards.\nTap the \"Add to Queue\" button to add the research project to the research queue, allowing you to complete a number of research projects in sequence in the order in which they were added to the queue. Queued projects cannot be cancelled in any way, and up to five projects can be queued at once.\nWhen a queued project is completed, the next project in the queue will automatically be started.\nYou can refresh the list of research projects by tapping the \"Refresh\" button at the bottom-right corner of the screen.\nIf a research project is currently active, you will not be able to refresh the project list until you add it to the research queue.",
