		type = 17,
		desc = "To visit the Cattery, head from the home screen to \"HQ\", then tap on the \"Cat Lodge\" button.\nTap the \"Order\" button to order cat boxes from Akashi Express. The first cat box you order each day is free, and up to 15 cat boxes can be purchased daily by spending Coins.\nThere are three rarities of cat boxes: rare, elite, and super rare. Each has a certain percentage chance to appear when ordering cat boxes.\nMeowfficers of the same name have the same skill, but can learn different talents. By equipping them in the Meowfficer slot of your fleet, your whole fleet will gain certain buffs. Additional benefits may also be granted depending on the Meowfficer's skill. Meowfficers cannot be deployed to certain stages.",
