		name = "Acquire any META shipgirl 1 time.",
		guild_coin_award = 0,
		award = 0,
		type = 17,
		desc = "You can obtain META shipgirls either by participating in Operation Siren, or by leveling up your Cruise Pass to a certain stage.\nSynchronization Points collected in Operation Siren's META Showdowns are linked to the META Lab, accessible by heading from the home screen to \"Lab\", then selecting \"META Lab\". After accumulating enough Synchronization Points specific to a META shipgirl, you will be able to obtain her.\nAfter obtaining a META shipgirl, you can further strengthen her through the functionalities of the META Lab.\nIf you obtain duplicate copies of a META shipgirl, that dupe will instead be converted into META Crystals for that specific shipgirl. The crystals can then be used to limit break that shipgirl in Somatic Activation.\nYou can level up the skills of META shipgirls either by completing Tactical Training missions, or by using META Universal Skill Books.\nYou can improve the FP, TRP, AVI, and RLD stats of META shipgirls by consuming materials in Rigging Fortification.",
